# Route: guide 27 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Undead
# (1199 of 1215 eligible quests, 157.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 48 to
# 51, 29 quests, 5.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Hinterlands, Hillsbrad Foothills, Tirisfal Glades): Hiri'watha ->
# The Overlook Cliffs -> Jintha'Alor -> Skulk Rock -> The Creeping Ruin -> The
# Altar of Zul -> Valorwind Lake -> Quel'Danil Lodge -> Valorwind Lake ->
# Agol'watha -> Shaol'watha -> The Overlook Cliffs -> Shaol'watha -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Gammerita, Mon! (7816; Gammerita
# 48); Wanted: Vile Priestess Hexx and Her Minions (7861; Vile Priestess Hexx
# 51, Vilebranch Aman'zasi Guard 50-51); Job Opening: Guard Captain of
# Revantusk Village (7862; Vilebranch Berserker 47-48, Vilebranch Shadow
# Hunter 48-49, Vilebranch Blood Drinker 49-50, Vilebranch Soul Eater 49-50);
# Recover the Key! (7846; Hitah'ya the Keeper 51); The Crown of Will (518;
# Crushridge Mauler 36-37).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Jammal'an the Prophet (1446), The Grave Knight (96986),
# Vorrel's Revenge (1051), Barov Family Fortune (5341), The Wrath of Rath'mael
# (92422), The Wrath of Rath'mael (92422), Crest of Lordaeron (95204),
# Unending Torment (97288).

